Project: Patient Health Record Management System
🔹 Description: A simple CLI-based system where users (doctors or patients) can store, retrieve, and analyze basic medical records (e.g., blood pressure, temperature, symptoms).
🔹 Features:

Add patient records (name, age, BP, temperature, diagnosis).

View patient history.

Search for a patient by name or ID.

Save records in a file (basic file handling).

Provide basic health analysis (e.g., flag high BP, fever alerts).
